\details{
Splits cells by \code{block_labels} and computes trajectory-level temporal
effect size, identity effect, peak pseudotime, and evaluability per block.
Bin scores from the pooled \code{scores_df} are localised using block-specific
lineage-weighted bin occupancy; optional \code{merged_df} or calibration tables
supply trajectory-level identity p-values.
